  "how_measured": "A classifier sees 24-month region series (provinces with >= 50 hotspots per month, held-out regions and years) and guesses which one is real MODIS. 'harmonized' compares real MODIS with a draw from Calember's calibrated predictive distribution (mean of 3 seeds); 0.5 means the two cannot be told apart. 'harmonized_expectation' uses the smooth calendar values instead, which are averages and therefore easier to spot."
